{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate between stationary horror and top-down stealth in this game where time is always against you. At night, complete tasks on your PC while keeping various AIs docile. In the day, look for clues, study patrol routes, and learn to run and hide as you plot your escape. The clock is ticking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/1a0c1fe7d64bbb053e7826ac522ea095.poster.avif?t=1770952188\" aria-label=\"Complete tasks under stressful circumstances.\" width=638 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/1a0c1fe7d64bbb053e7826ac522ea095.webm?t=1770952188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/1a0c1fe7d64bbb053e7826ac522ea095.mp4?t=1770952188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your job is simple: fix DOC\u2019s faulty code before the night grows too late. Enter passwords, answer little math problems\u2026 Sounds easy enough, doesn\u2019t it? However\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/0b1351137c4a1068ddd12f38e36712a9.poster.avif?t=1770952188\" aria-label=\"Balance multiple resources to survive\" width=638 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/0b1351137c4a1068ddd12f38e36712a9.webm?t=1770952188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/0b1351137c4a1068ddd12f38e36712a9.mp4?t=1770952188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to keep track of many things throughout the night. Protect your PC from being hacked, care for a virtual pet, and resist sleep with a shot of coffee\u2026 Failure is not permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/8902bc67e1a529110dee21f1eb40c588.poster.avif?t=1770952188\" width=638 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/8902bc67e1a529110dee21f1eb40c588.webm?t=1770952188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/8902bc67e1a529110dee21f1eb40c588.mp4?t=1770952188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day is your chance to find a way out. Search for clues while staying out of trouble, but you\u2019ll have to hurry: time is always so short!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/a11de9e1d4457f1ebb8fcc57d3d6041c.poster.avif?t=1770952188\" width=638 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/a11de9e1d4457f1ebb8fcc57d3d6041c.webm?t=1770952188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect intel on the security staff and learn their schedules. If you know when they\u2019re relieved, you can seize the opportunity to sneak by\u2026 You might also find some hints on how to solve future problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 nights and 7 days of \u201cgood\u201d, \u201chonest\u201d \u201cwork\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ever-present time limit for \u201cmotivation\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 AIs that are always there to \u201chelp\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFriendly\u201d colleagues ready to \u201cshow you the ropes\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cSpecial\u201d \u201cpost-game\u201d \u201cchallenges\u201d.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904180?t=1770952188","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904180?t=1770952188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/f60fab26b7066b5c9f6a87c41e44f2137a94a49f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770952188","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/f60fab26b7066b5c9f6a87c41e44f2137a94a49f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770952188","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4099390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate between stationary horror and top-down stealth in this game where time is always against you. At night, complete tasks on your PC while keeping various AIs docile. In the day, look for clues, study patrol routes, and learn to run and hide as you plot your escape. The clock is ticking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/1a0c1fe7d64bbb053e7826ac522ea095.poster.avif?t=1770952188\" aria-label=\"Complete tasks under stressful circumstances.\" width=638 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/1a0c1fe7d64b