.mp4?t=1770952188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day is your chance to find a way out. Search for clues while staying out of trouble, but you\u2019ll have to hurry: time is always so short!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/a11de9e1d4457f1ebb8fcc57d3d6041c.poster.avif?t=1770952188\" width=638 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/extras/a11de9e1d4457f1ebb8fcc57d3d6041c.webm?t=1770952188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect intel on the security staff and learn their schedules. If you know when they\u2019re relieved, you can seize the opportunity to sneak by\u2026 You might also find some hints on how to solve future problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 nights and 7 days of \u201cgood\u201d, \u201chonest\u201d \u201cwork\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ever-present time limit for \u201cmotivation\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 AIs that are always there to \u201chelp\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFriendly\u201d colleagues ready to \u201cshow you the ropes\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cSpecial\u201d \u201cpost-game\u201d \u201cchallenges\u201d.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Logan Elaire"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904180/13096c7e21277506848b07057c31d711a74fe34e/header.jpg?t=1770952188","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3904180/1451998413/560ee